## Methodology & Training Foundation

The safety architecture here — scope boundaries, escalation triggers, disclaimer requirements, and red-flag detection patterns — was developed applying principles from IBM SkillsBuild's chatbot safety and healthcare AI curriculum. That coursework (including a separate red-flag triage exercise) lives in [`healthcare-ai-informatics-portfolio`](https://github.com/AbioyeStephen/healthcare-ai-informatics-portfolio) — this repo is the applied, deployed extension of those same principles into a full administrative system design.

